;Description
:This template is used to link to an Bluesky account.
;Syntax
:Place <code><nowiki>{{Bluesky|<username>}}</nowiki></code> and substitute <username> with the latter part of the Utaite's Bluesky Profile link. If necessary, use the article's talk page to discuss further details.

;Example<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:<pre>{{Bluesky|yukimi-n.bsky.social|yukimi bluesky description}}</pre>

;Will result in<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:{{Bluesky|yukimi-n.bsky.social|yukimi bluesky description}}

;note<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:description field is optional.

